hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1130","Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna told us, Abdul Aziz bin Abdul Samad told us, Mansour told us, Yusuf bin Musa told us, Jarir told us, on the authority of Mansour, H. Amr bin Ali and Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawrqi narrated to us, saying: Abd al-Aziz bin Abd al-Samad narrated to us, on the authority of Mansour, H Yahya bin Hakim told us, Abu Dawud, Abu Al-Ahwas told us, on the authority of Mansour, on the authority of Abu Wael, on the authority of Abdullah bin Masoud That a man came to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and said: So-and-so fell asleep yesterday and missed the prayer. The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “That A devil urinated in his ear, or in his ears.” This is the wording of the hadith of Abu Musa"
